1
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:07,731
Decimeter

2
00:00:07,731 --> 00:00:10,711
Meter

3
00:00:10,711 --> 00:00:15,350
Kilometer

4
00:00:17,975 --> 00:00:23,640
Which length units have we learned?

5
00:00:26,049 --> 00:00:36,114
Centimeter is a length unit.

6
00:00:37,284 --> 00:00:42,645
Centimeter is abbreviated as cm.

7
00:00:49,403 --> 00:00:58,350
Decimeter is a length unit.

8
00:01:00,032 --> 00:01:06,087
Decimeter is abbreviated as dm.

9
00:01:08,054 --> 00:01:15,405
1 dm = 10 cm

10
00:01:17,020 --> 00:01:24,451
10 cm = 1 dm

11
00:01:29,898 --> 00:01:35,703
Meter is a length unit.

12
00:01:36,944 --> 00:01:40,984
Meter is abbreviated as m.

13
00:01:42,904 --> 00:01:47,949
1 m = 10 dm

14
00:01:48,757 --> 00:01:54,564
1 m = 100 cm

15
00:01:58,844 --> 00:02:09,385
Kilometer is a length unit.

16
00:02:11,307 --> 00:02:16,293
Kilometer is abbreviated as km.

17
00:02:17,476 --> 00:02:23,511
1 km = 1000 m

18
00:02:30,231 --> 00:02:40,557
We just learned the length units centimeter, decimeter, meter, kilometer.

